<.empty_state title="Vertex not found" class="page-state" {@rest}>
  <:icon><.icon_search /></:icon>
  Nothing in the graph has this address. It may have gone since the last introspection,
  or the link may be wrong.
  <:action>
    <%!-- The lens's start page, which opens on the app's own page. --%>
    <.link patch={Path.join(@prefix, @lens.id)} class="empty-state-action">Go home</.link>
  </:action>
</.empty_state>
